<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bologna 0 Perugia 0. Attendance: 23,000</p>
<p>Milan 0 Parma 1 (Stanic 45th minute). Halftime: 0-1. 50,000</p>
<p>Napoli 1 (Cruz 90) Lazio 0. 0-0. 60,000</p>
<p>Piacenza 1 (Delli Carri 85) Juventus 1 (Lucci 69 - own-goal). 0-0. 20,000</p>
<p>Reggiana 1 (Pacheo 42) Inter 1 (Djorkaeff 64). 1-0. 15,000</p>
<p>Roma 0 Atalanta 2 (Lanna 30 own-goal, Inzaghi 36). 0-2. 47,000</p>
<p>Sampdoria 2 (Montella 15 and 25) Vicenza 1 (Otero 82 - penalty). 2-0. 24,000</p>
<p>Verona 3 (Maniero 47 and 90, Orlandini 62 - penalty) Udinese 2 (Poggi 19, Stroppa 54). 0-1. 12,000</p>
